estion/answer-fields "answer-field-102d43bf-f5e9-5d2c-bd0c-f23bbb64ece6"] [17592186129079 :knowledge-point/questions "question-6cd59b40-dc86-5174-9cba-78e6f66091cf"] ["question-d5913a4b-d974-52bc-82fc-74c4bb66f8ca" :question/id #uuid "d5913a4b-d974-52bc-82fc-74c4bb66f8ca"] ["question-d5913a4b-d974-52bc-82fc-74c4bb66f8ca" :question/math-academy-id "q-102710"] ["question-d5913a4b-d974-52bc-82fc-74c4bb66f8ca" :question/problem "Consider the surface ${e}^{xy}-{x}^{2}-2{z}^{2}=e-3.$ Given that $n=⟨a,b,c⟩$ is a non-zero normal vector to the surface at the point $(1,1,-1),$ what is the value of $\\frac{a-b}{c}?$"] ["question-d5913a4b-d974-52bc-82fc-74c4bb66f8ca" :question/worked-solution "Let's define  $f(x,y,z)={e}^{xy}-{x}^{2}-2{z}^{2}.$ Then, our surface can be viewed as the level surface $f(x,y,z)=e-3.$  \n\nNow, we find the gradient of $f(x,y,z)$ and evaluate it at $(1,1,-1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x,y,z) & ={f}_{x}(x,y,z)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y,z)\\,j+{f}_{z}(x,y,z)\\,k \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({e}^{xy}-{x}^{2}-2{z}^{2})i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}({e}^{xy}-{x}^{2}-2{z}^{2}))j+\\frac{∂}{∂z}({e}^{xy}-{x}^{2}-2{z}^{2})k \\\\  & =(y{e}^{xy}-2x)i+(x{e}^{xy})j+(-4z)k \\\\ ∇f(1,1,-1) & =((1){e}^{(1)(1)}-2(1))\\text{ }i+(1){e}^{(1)(1)}\\text{ }j+(-4)(-1)\\text{ }k \\\\  & =(e-2)\\text{ }i+e\\text{ }j+4\\text{ }k \\\\  & =⟨e-2,\\,e,\\,4⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our normal vector is $n=⟨a,b,c⟩=⟨e-2,\\,e,\\,4⟩.$\n\nFinally, $\\frac{a-b}{c}=\\frac{(e-2)-e}{4}=-\\frac{1}{2}.$"] ["question-d5913a4b-d974-52bc-82fc-74c4bb66f8ca" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-d777c8fd-8f4e-5ca8-a5be-b50636868cd0" :answer-field/id #uuid "d777c8fd-8f4e-5ca8-a5be-b50636868cd0"] ["answer-003c768f-4220-5a83-901d-9287c7398508" :answer/id #uuid "003c768f-4220-5a83-901d-9287c7398508"] ["answer-003c768f-4220-5a83-901d-9287c7398508" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-003c768f-4220-5a83-901d-9287c7398508" :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}"] ["answer-d5390bff-ed73-5aab-86b6-9bd0d5dc8156" :answer/id #uuid "d5390bff-ed73-5aab-86b6-9bd0d5dc8156"] ["answer-d5390bff-ed73-5aab-86b6-9bd0d5dc8156" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d5390bff-ed73-5aab-86b6-9bd0d5dc8156" :answer/value "4"] ["answer-c65e5475-456e-5a45-8351-be33d7aba2f9" :answer/id #uuid "c65e5475-456e-5a45-8351-be33d7aba2f9"] ["answer-c65e5475-456e-5a45-8351-be33d7aba2f9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c65e5475-456e-5a45-8351-be33d7aba2f9" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}"] ["answer-189491e7-f8db-50dd-a6d1-6eeaca6515ff" :answer/id #uuid "189491e7-f8db-50dd-a6d1-6eeaca6515ff"] ["answer-189491e7-f8db-50dd-a6d1-6eeaca6515ff" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-189491e7-f8db-50dd-a6d1-6eeaca6515ff" :answer/value "\\frac{e-2}{4}"] ["answer-f88cff99-c81a-54d6-be8d-ad3057aab4a8" :answer/id #uuid "f88cff99-c81a-54d6-be8d-ad3057aab4a8"] ["answer-f88cff99-c81a-54d6-be8d-ad3057aab4a8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f88cff99-c81a-54d6-be8d-ad3057aab4a8" :answer/value "e-2"] ["answer-field-d777c8fd-8f4e-5ca8-a5be-b50636868cd0" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-d777c8fd-8f4e-5ca8-a5be-b50636868cd0" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-d777c8fd-8f4e-5ca8-a5be-b50636868cd0" :answer-field/correct "answer-003c768f-4220-5a83-901d-9287c7398508"] ["answer-field-d777c8fd-8f4e-5ca8-a5be-b50636868cd0" :answer-field/choices "answer-003c768f-4220-5a83-901d-9287c7398508"] ["answer-field-d777c8fd-8f4e-5ca8-a5be-b50636868cd0" :answer-field/choices "answer-d5390bff-ed73-5aab-86b6-9bd0d5dc8156"] ["answer-field-d777c8fd-8f4e-5ca8-a5be-b50636868cd0" :answer-field/choices "answer-c65e5475-456e-5a45-8351-be33d7aba2f9"] ["answer-field-d777c8fd-8f4e-5ca8-a5be-b50636868cd0" :answer-field/choices "answer-189491e7-f8db-50dd-a6d1-6eeaca6515ff"] ["answer-field-d777c8fd-8f4e-5ca8-a5be-b50636868cd0" :answer-field/choices "answer-f88cff99-c81a-54d6-be8d-ad3057aab4a8"] ["question-d5913a4b-d974-52bc-82fc-74c4bb66f8ca" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-d777c8fd-8f4e-5ca8-a5be-b50636868cd0"] [17592186129179 :knowledge-point/questions "question-d5913a4b-d974-52bc-82fc-74c4bb66f8ca"] ["question-138bcf11-9efc-57ee-ad7b-ef21818db0e7" :question/id #uuid "138bcf11-9efc-57ee-ad7b-ef21818db0e7"] ["question-138bcf11-9efc-57ee-ad7b-ef21818db0e7" :question/math-academy-id "q-102712"] ["question-138bcf11-9efc-57ee-ad7b-ef21818db0e7" :question/problem "Consider the surface ${z}^{2}y+16=4\\sqrt{x}+y.$ Find the equation of the tangent plane to that surface at the point $(4,-1,3).$"] ["question-138bcf11-9efc-57ee-ad7b-ef21818db0e7" :question/worked-solution "First, we bring all variables to one side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{z}^{2}y+16 & =4\\sqrt{x}+y. \\\\ {z}^{2}y-4\\sqrt{x}-y & =-16\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we set $f(x,y,z)={z}^{2}y-4\\sqrt{x}-y$, our surface can be viewed as the level surface $f(x,y,z)=-16.$ \n\nRecall that the equation of the tangent plane to the level surface $f(x,y,z)=k$ at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ can be expressed as\n\n$$\n∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0},\\,z-{z}_{0}⟩=0.\n$$\n\nNow, we find the gradient of $f(x,y,z)$ and evaluate it at $(4,-1,3):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\,f(x,y,z) & ={f}_{x}(x,y,z)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y,z)\\,j+{f}_{z}(x,y,z)\\,k \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({z}^{2}y-4\\sqrt{x}-y)\\text{ }i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}({z}^{2}y-4\\sqrt{x}-y)\\text{ }j+\\frac{∂}{∂z}({z}^{2}y-4\\sqrt{x}-y)\\text{ }k \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{x}}\\text{ }i+({z}^{2}-1)\\text{ }j+2zy\\text{ }k \\\\ ∇\\,f(4,-1,3) & =-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4}}\\text{ }i+({3}^{2}-1)\\text{ }j+2(3)(-1)\\text{ }k \\\\  & =-\\,i+8\\text{ }j-6\\,k \\\\  & =⟨-1,8,-6⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can now write down the Cartesian equation of the tangent plane to the level surface, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0},\\,z-{z}_{0}⟩ & =0 \\\\ ∇f(4,-1,3)\\cdot ⟨x-4,\\,y+1,\\,z-3⟩ & =0 \\\\ ⟨-1,8,-6⟩\\cdot ⟨x-4,\\,y+1,\\,z-3⟩ & =0 \\\\ -(x-4)+8(y+1)-6(z-3) & =0 \\\\ -x+8y-6z+30 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-138bcf11-9efc-57ee-ad7b-ef21818db0e7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-74e95cce-259a-58bc-a6dc-cf74c51c993b" :answer-field/id #uuid "74e95cce-259a-58bc-a6dc-cf74c51c993b"] ["answer-ea005b66-1e1f-575c-a788-5fbfb346d025" :answer/id #uuid "ea005b66-1e1f-575c-a788-5fbfb346d025"] ["answer-ea005b66-1e1f-575c-a788-5fbfb346d025" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ea005b66-1e1f-575c-a788-5fbfb346d025" :answer/value "-x+8y-6z+30=0"] ["answer-bd87e438-6635-5fc8-8041-e85ff749d4dd" :answer/id #uuid "bd87e438-6635-5fc8-8041-e85ff749d4dd"] ["answer-bd87e438-6635-5fc8-8041-e85ff749d4dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-bd87e438-6635-5fc8-8041-e85ff749d4dd" :answer/value "-x+9y-z+16=0"] ["answer-d50bfffc-a66c-5b56-a37e-a72964286f8c" :answer/id #uuid "d50bfffc-a66c-5b56-a37e-a72964286f8c"] ["answer-d50bfffc-a66c-5b56-a37e-a72964286f8c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d50bfffc-a66c-5b56-a37e-a72964286f8c" :answer/value "3x+5y-6z-3=0"] ["answer-8da732bc-eb58-5338-abe0-8d52e81e25e9" :answer/id #uuid "8da732bc-eb58-5338-abe0-8d52e81e25e9"] ["answer-8da732bc-eb58-5338-abe0-8d52e81e25e9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-8da732bc-eb58-5338-abe0-8d52e81e25e9" :answer/value "3x+8y-5z+12=0"] ["answer-065677e5-6668-589c-8f82-28615b7c7eea" :answer/id #uuid "065677e5-6668-589c-8f82-28615b7c7eea"] ["answer-065677e5-6668-589c-8f82-28615b7c7eea" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-065677e5-6668-589c-8f82-28615b7c7eea" :answer/value "x-6y+z-13=0"] ["answer-field-74e95cce-259a-58bc-a6dc-cf74c51c993b" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-74e95cce-259a-58bc-a6dc-cf74c51c993b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-74e95cce-259a-58bc-a6dc-cf74c51c993b" :answer-field/correct "answer-ea005b66-1e1f-575c-a788-5fbfb346d025"] ["answer-field-74e95cce-259a-58bc-a6dc-cf74c51c993b" :answer-field/choices "answer-ea005b66-1e1f-575c-a788-5fbfb346d025"] ["answer-field-74e95cce-259a-58bc-a6dc-cf74c51